{"id":"n91573-1-7","stage":4,"title":"점포 · 店","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91573-1-7-1","ko":"옆 동네에 점포를 또 차리신다면서요?","zh":"听说您要在隔壁社区再开一家店是吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옆","meaning":"旁边，附近","explanation":"옆：旁边，附近","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"2","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동네에","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점포를","meaning":"店，店铺","explanation":"점포：店，店铺；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점포","audio":"/audio/05fb50cc223ea0dc6d80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91573","senseId":"1","lemma":"점포","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차리신다면서요?","meaning":"开设，建立，设置，组建","explanation":"차리다：开设，建立，设置，组建；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ다면서요：引用所听到的动作陈述，再向对方确认。","readings":[{"term":"차리다","audio":"/audio/967898219777e9f4fca1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71366","senseId":"6","lemma":"차리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c140e1936b454b24","term":"옆","zh":"旁边，附近","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3","entryId":"20243","definition":"离某地不远的地方。","pronunciation":["엽"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"05fb50cc223ea0dc","term":"점포","zh":"店，店铺","audio":"/audio/05fb50cc223ea0dc6d80.mp3","entryId":"91573","definition":"卖东西的地方。","pronunciation":["점ː포"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"967898219777e9f4","term":"차리다","zh":"开设，建立，设置，组建","audio":"/audio/967898219777e9f4fca1.mp3","entryId":"71366","definition":"安置新家或重新开办店铺或公司等。","pronunciation":["차리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/23f4b846a7cbb1c3a1da.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91573-1-7-2","ko":"네, 요즘 장사가 잘 되어서요.","zh":"是的，因为最近生意很好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장사가","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，有效地","explanation":"잘：很好地，有效地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"13","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되어서요.","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b5b81ac6a045174c","term":"장사","zh":"生意，经商","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3","entryId":"71699","definition":"为获取利益而买卖东西；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["장사"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，有效地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"功能或效果让人满意地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利，不错","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"事情发展得很好。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a5fe212755ceb6030cb4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91573","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，因为最近生意很好。","听说您要在隔壁社区再开一家店是吗？","今天早上怎么迟到了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说您要在隔壁社区再开一家店是吗？","今天早上怎么迟到了？","是的，因为最近生意很好。"],"answer":2}]}
